SUMMARY:8th Grade Promotion
DESCRIPTION:We invite all 8th grade families to join us for the promotion of Sherwood Charter School’s 8th grade students! \nWednesday\, June 4th\, 2025\n5:30 pm to 6:30\nSherwood Charter School Auditorium \nA promotion reception will be held immediately following the ceremony in the gym. \n*If your student is participating in the ceremony\, please have them dress in uniform or nicer and arrive to Mrs. Iliscupidez’s classroom no later than 5:15 pm. They will be walking over to the auditorium as a class for the ceremony.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/8th-grade-promotion-5/
